Package: nanopi-audio
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: all
Maintainer: __MAINTAINER__
Depends: mpd, mpc, mosquitto, mosquitto-clients, alsa-utils, python3, device-tree-compiler
Recommends: ffmpeg
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: __HOMEPAGE__
Description: I2S audio (MAX98357A) + web UI + MQTT for NanoPi NEO
 Turns a NanoPi NEO (Allwinner H3, sun8i) into a small networked audio
 player. Ships a MAX98357A I2S DAC device-tree overlay, an MPD output
 configuration, a dependency-free web UI (track list, file upload,
 playback, volume, loop, and network/static-IP settings with safe
 auto-revert) and an MQTT bridge with command topics (track / volume /
 play / loop) plus published state and log topics.
 .
 A reboot is required after installation for the sound card to appear,
 because the audio overlay is applied by U-Boot at boot time.
